{"id":1060103,"chapter_id":1060103,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"“保持距离，不要伤害她。”这是你在出发前对警卫们下达的唯一命令。","style":3,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"可她毕竟拥有能压制黑环的幻象能力……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"我不会做任何违背MBCC立场的事，关于这点，你能相信我吗？","style":2,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"当然。","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"那也请相信我的判断，我会找到让MBCC和哈梅尔都满意的解决方案。","style":2,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"在反抗和自我牺牲中，她向来选择的都是后者。","style":2,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"回到舞台，跳自己想跳的——这是她唯一为自己做出的选择，我希望能成全她。","style":2,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"根据前方警卫传回的定位，你和夜莺一行终于在临近嘉年华还有一千米左右的位置追上了哈梅尔。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"content":"提前抵达的警卫一路跟在哈梅尔身后，因为你的指令，他们一直保持着一定距离不敢妄动。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"options":["哈梅尔，停下！我们谈谈。"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103011,"trial_step":11,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"哈梅尔，停下！我们谈谈。","goto":12}]},{"step":11,"content":"她好像已经听不见其他的声音，心无旁骛地徒步慢慢向嘉年华的方向走去。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"content":"哈梅尔，我已经知道你真正想要的是什么了。你想要一个能接纳你的舞台，对吗？","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"她依然没有回头。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"content":"哈梅尔！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"锈河境内满地的污水和泥泞，但这些却丝毫没有弄脏哈梅尔的双足。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"content":"她就像一只一心归家的幽魂，轻轻漂浮着，向那露出废墟本貌的黑环遗址靠近。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"speaker":"幽影","content":"没用的……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"熟悉的黑影拦在你面前。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"speaker":"幽影","content":"她只想回到那里，没有人可以阻挠她。","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"speaker":"幽影","content":"没有人——","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"幽影话音落下，靛蓝色的幻境立刻铺满了视野。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"所有人都被包裹入深海般的虚像中，幽影腾空而起，幻象急速延伸，封死了道路的各个角落，同时也完全遮住了前方哈梅尔的背影。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"content":"又是你……哈梅尔负面情绪的具象幽影，对吗？你这次又要做什么？","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"幽影","content":"我不会让你们靠近她的。","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"options":["我只是想帮她"],"style":6,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103026,"trial_step":26,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我只是想帮她","goto":27}]},{"step":26,"content":"我在梦里看见了她的过去，我完全理解她想要回到嘉年华的心情。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"speaker":"幽影","content":"哈哈，理解……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"幽影","content":"有多少人曾这样欺骗过她，我已经不会再相信了——","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"“歘！”你没来得及争辩，幽影毫无征兆地向你发起攻击。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长小心！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"content":"夜莺及时开枪，子弹与触手相互抵消了攻击。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你有个好副官，有那么多听从命令的部下，还有那些禁闭者……他们都把你当做朋友，认同你的选择……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"speaker":"幽影","content":"但哈梅尔呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"content":"幽影忽左忽右地飘动，语气时而悲痛时而愠怒。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"speaker":"幽影","content":"哈梅尔没有理解自己的亲人，没有能欣赏自己的朋友。","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"幽影","content":"甚至……她只认识二十三年前的狄斯，现在的狄斯城，连她熟悉的地方都没有。","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你们清除了死役，夺去了所有的观众，而她……她只有嘉年华了……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"幽影再一次向你逼近，夜莺第一时间举枪瞄准。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"options":["等等，让它说下去。"],"style":6,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103040,"trial_step":40,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"等等，让它说下去。","goto":41}]},{"step":40,"content":"虽然眼前的水母言辞激烈，与哈梅尔的性格截然不同，但它本质是哈梅尔一切负面思绪的载体。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"它所说的话背后，或许也代表了哈梅尔一直不曾宣之于口的想法。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"speaker":"幽影","content":"悲痛、破碎、脆弱——这是狄斯的未来啊，是美的预言，是她感知到的一切！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"幽影","content":"休想捆住舞者的手脚，休想让她为所见之美静默，休想让她重回牢笼！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"speaker":"幽影","content":"舞者，要回到舞台！！！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"content":"说罢，幽影开始原地旋转，与此同时，靛蓝色的幻境也开始随它一同扭曲变换。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"天旋地转的景象立刻让你感到生理上的不适。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"content":"我不是为了抓她……","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"content":"幽影根本不给你解释的机会，幻境进一步扩张，不只是视觉折磨，如同海妖低鸣般的声音加入，进一步加剧了眩晕。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"content":"受牵连的不止你一人，警卫甚至夜莺都不约而同出现头晕恶心的反应。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"content":"嗡！枷锁熟悉的刺痛感再次袭来，有新的情况正在发生。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"我又回来给你们跳舞了，你们还记得我吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"content":"哈梅尔对着空无一人的嘉年华废墟，露出怀念的微笑。与此同时在嘉年华外，大批游荡的死役对着天空抬起头。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"speaker":"游荡的死役","content":"哈梅尔……跳舞……为我们……讲述……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"content":"他们重复着哈梅尔的名字向同一个方向慢慢移动。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"content":"不能再拖延了，无论是为了制止死役继续向嘉年华聚集，还是为了哈梅尔的精神状态，你都必须尽快和这只臭水母做个了结。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"content":"我本来不想和你动手，因为你说你是哈梅尔的一部分，伤害你不知道会对她造成什么副作用。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"content":"但既然你没法静下心来听我说话，那就只能强迫合作了。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103059,"trial_step":59,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":60}]},{"step":59,"content":"你伸出右手，枷锁在掌心泄出猩红色的暗芒，却在触碰到幽影的一瞬间化作了深海的泡沫。<color=#fb9259>枷锁对它不起作用？</color>","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，泡沫只是幻术，它的力量明显减弱了，再尝试一次一定……！！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"speaker":"幽影","content":"住口！我不会让任何人阻止哈梅尔！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"content":"说着，它跃至空中，黑色的幻影舒展，带起了空气的流动，将周身的一切都托举到空中。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"content":"无辜的参战者都被卷入幻境，瓦砾、飞石、幻象……除了身处圆心的你，一切都正伴随幽影的幻境旋转。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103065,"trial_step":65,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":66}]},{"step":65,"content":"泡沫包裹住你的手掌，再次吞噬了枷锁的红光，幽影拦在你面前。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你真的理解她，包容她吗？那你手中的枷锁又是什么？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"content":"枷锁同样可以遏制她的狂厄，避免她精神状况继续恶化。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"speaker":"幽影","content":"但狂厄带来幻觉是她舞蹈的灵魂之一！","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"content":"所以我必须过去！比起恶化她狂厄和精神的死役，能用枷锁防止意外的我才是更合适的观众。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你……你不是来抓她的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"content":"我是要将她带回去，但我更希望能试着实现她的心愿。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"content":"她想要那些能欣赏悲伤之舞的观众。停止蛊惑死役，我去做她的观众。无论她感知到的世界是怎样的，只要是哈梅尔的舞蹈，我都愿意欣赏。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"speaker":"幽影","content":"没有私心，没有利用，没有压迫？你可以一直让她跳她想跳的？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"content":"当然。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"content":"跳到她觉得尽兴为止。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"speaker":"幽影","content":"尽兴……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"水母状的黑影没有表情，但你看得出它已经放松了戒备。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"content":"这一次不再有幻觉干扰，红色的尖刺从你掌心一路蔓延。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"content":"哈梅尔一直优先考虑别人的感受，把自己最热烈的愿望藏在最深处，一直积压。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"content":"困惑、迷茫、孤独……还是要谢谢你，让我看到她的噩梦，帮她把这些话说出来。","style":2,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"content":"枷锁的尖刺与幽影相互缠绕，轻轻一用力，它就化为一阵黑烟。","style":3,"background":711,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"content":"随着幽影的消散，靛蓝色的幻境也渐渐褪去。自深夜梦中惊醒到连夜追赶，原来幻境之外已经是黎明。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103084,"trial_step":84},{"step":83,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，您真的要一个人去吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103086,"trial_step":86},{"step":84,"content":"所有被卷入半空的人都被轻轻放回了地面。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103087,"trial_step":87},{"step":85,"content":"哈梅尔从没有想过伤害任何人，即便是她最负面偏激的化身，也没有给MBCC带来任何损失。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103088,"trial_step":88},{"step":86,"content":"别担心，有枷锁在，我不会有事的。黑环活跃时的嘉年华我都能走出来，还会被这片废墟困住吗？","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103089,"trial_step":89},{"step":87,"content":"在我出来之前，你们就留在原地待命。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103090,"trial_step":90},{"step":88,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"可是……","voice":["vo_trial_60103_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103091,"trial_step":91},{"step":89,"content":"副官对你仍然不太放心。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103092,"trial_step":92},{"step":90,"content":"别忘了，在来的路上你答应过，会相信我的选择。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103093,"trial_step":93},{"step":91,"content":"我只是去看一场舞。散场之后，我会把健康、清醒的舞者，带回来的。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":160103094,"trial_step":94}]}